.TH MLH-SETTINGS-TUI 1 "November 2026" "mlh" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mlh-settings-tui \- edit mlh settings in a terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mlh-settings-tui
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the same mlh settings in a terminal on Linux and macOS.
Use the up and down arrow keys to choose an item, Enter to edit it,
.B r
to reset it, Ctrl-S to save, and
.B q
to exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mlh-settings-gtk (1),
.BR mlh-settings-backend (1)
